OL,3,GNEWSAChild rapist put vodka in baby's
OL,4,Abottle before abusing her
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who raped and abused vulnerable
OL,7,Fchildren for 20 years put vodka into a
OL,8,Fbaby's bottle before sexually
OL,9,Fassaulting her, a court has heard.
OL,11,FIan Whyte, 62, carried out a campaign
OL,12,Fof abuse against youngsters in
OL,13,FEdinburgh between December 1978 and May
OL,14,F1998.
OL,16,FThe attack on the baby girl took place
OL,17,Fbetween September 1982 and September
OL,18,F1983 - when Whyte was about 18 years
OL,19,Fold and the baby was under a year old.
